"ター <pymalloc>`。"

msgid ""
"``PYMEM_ALLOCATOR_PYMALLOC_DEBUG`` (``6``): :ref:`Python pymalloc memory "
"allocator <pymalloc>` with :ref:`debug hooks <pymem-debug-hooks>`."
msgstr ""
"``PYMEM_ALLOCATOR_PYMALLOC_DEBUG`` (``6``): :ref:`Python の pymalloc メモリア"
